      "pos": 13,
      "text": "Kleven, Landais, and S\u00f8gaard found that Danish mothers' earnings fully recover within three years of childbirth.",
      "factual": false,
      "stance": "asserted"
    },
    {
      "id": "a13",
      "pos": 14,
      "text": "The laboratory experiment by Correll, Benard, and Paik showed that mothers received fewer callbacks than equally qualified childless women.",
      "factual": true,
      "stance": "asserted"
